 percentage.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-19\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"Q-2\",\n    \"ASM-4\",\n    \"ASM-17\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A weekly report is generated and designated stakeholder email addresses are configured\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-20.1\",\n     \"level\": \"job\",\n     \"then\": \"the outbound email-service call contains the stakeholder recipients and the generated report\",\n     \"when\": \"the report email job runs\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An authenticated parking administrator changes the designated stakeholder recipient list\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-20.2\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"the returned recipient list contains the updated addresses\",\n     \"when\": \"the list is read for the next report\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An authenticated employee who is not a parking administrator submits a stakeholder recipient-list update\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-20.3\",\n     \"level\": \"api\",\n     \"then\": \"the response status is non-success and the returned recipient list remains unchanged\",\n     \"when\": \"the update request is processed\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Folio3 parking web app shall email each weekly utilization report to the designated stakeholders using the configured stakeholder recipient list and permit only authenticated parking administrators to update that list.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-20\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-6\",\n    \"ASM-18\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A utilization evaluation identifies unused dedicated or temporary parking\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-21.1\",\n     \"level\": \"job\",\n     \"then\": \"no warning, suspension, or penalty row, event, email, or outbound enforcement call is created\",\n     \"when\": \"the evaluation and report jobs run\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Folio3 parking web app shall not create automated warnings, suspension